	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/graphics/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Draw the HUD from the high-res redraws; off\ndraws the game's own pictures."/>
		<string text="Classic: plain Xbox buttons. Gems: shaded Xbox\nbuttons. Dark Gems: the menu's button artwork."/>
		<string text="On a custom map, draw the campaign HUD. The reticle\nstays the map's. The next map uses the choice."/>
		<string text="Draw text and titles with high-res fonts; off\ndraws the game's own."/>
		<string text="Smooth jagged edges, which the Xbox did not. FXAA\nand SMAA are cheap; SSAA and MSAA are sharper."/>
		<string text="Smooth jagged edges, which the Xbox did not. FXAA\nis cheap; MSAA is sharper."/>
		<string text="Keep floors and walls sharp at a grazing angle,\nwhich the Xbox did not. Off: as the Xbox."/>
		<string text="The size objects' shadows are drawn at: 128 as on\nthe Xbox; larger for smoother, as soft, edges."/>
		<string text="Light models for each pixel, without the facets\nof the Xbox's lighting for each vertex."/>
		<string text="Stock picks models' detail by the Xbox's 480 lines;\nnative by this display's; highest, always the best."/>
		<string text="A clock at the bottom right in multiplayer.\nOn with Voice also plays the map's timer voice."/>
		<string text="In a team game, one player sees teammates from\ntheir own eyes, up to four panes."/>
		<string text="One local multiplayer player gets two panes, the\nother black. Campaign needs a second player."/>
		<string text="Which pane is yours when split screen is on.\nTwo panes are top and bottom."/>
		<string text="Hide mild slurs and strong swearing.\nInsults stay visible."/>
	</strings>
